<p>Subject: <strong>FORMATION OF DELEGATION OF ALL PAKISTAN MARBLE INDUSTRIES ASSOCIATION (APMIA) FOR XIAMEN STONE FAIR, CHINA FROM 06-09 MARCH, 2019</strong></p>
<p>Respected Members,</p>
<p>This is to inform you that All Pakistan Marble Industries Association (APMIA) is planning to make a TDAP approved delegation of 10 to 15 members to visit Xiamen Stone Fair, China to be held from 06-09 March, 2019.</p>
<p>Interested members can contact APMIA Head Office along with the copy of their passport and ID card, so we can send their details for the approval.</p>
<p>Last date of submission is <strong>13th February, 2019 (Wednesday)</strong></p>
<p><strong>(Note: This facility is only for APMIA members having valid membership, and it would be a self financed visit. All the members of the delegation will bare all of their expenses on their own including air ticketing, boarding, traveling, lodging etc)</strong></p>
<p>Thanking You.</p>
<p><strong>Chairman – Mian Gulzar Ahmad</strong></p>
<p><strong>BUSINESS VISA REQUIREMENTS FOR CHINA</strong></p>
<p><strong>Respected Members,</strong></p>
<p>Following are the business visa requirements to visit china to attend 18th China Xiamen International Stone Fair, China to be held from 06-09 March, 2019</p>
<ul>
<li>Three photographs with white background</li>
<li>Copy of passport with six months validity</li>
<li>Copy of China Visa (for those who already visited China)</li>
<li>Copy of CNIC</li>
<li>Copy of Local Chamber Certificate</li>
<li>Copy of NTN Certirificate</li>
<li>Copy of Membership Certificate of APMIA</li>
<li>Copy of Income Tax Return</li>
<li>Visa request on company letterhead to the Visa Officer</li>
<li>Police verification in case of travelling first time to China and attested from ministry of Foreign Affairs</li>
<li>Bank Statement of last six months.</li>
<li>Processing fee Rs. 20,000 (Rupees twenty thousand only) in the shape of Bank Draft / Pay Order or Cheque in favor of All Pakistan Marble Industries Association.</li>
<li>In case of applicant is not available or in case of rejection Rs. 10,000 (Rupees ten Thousand only) will be non-refundable.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Last date of the submission is 13th February, 2019</strong></p>";
